# Firebase Functions secrets — set via `firebase functions:secrets:set <NAME>`,
# not committed. Listed here so engineers know what the function expects.
#
# GITHUB_APP_ID            numeric ID of the registered GitHub App
# GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY   PEM contents (newlines literal `\n` or real newlines)
# GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET    HMAC secret configured on the GitHub App webhook (Phase 5)
